{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"**1. What it is** ✓\nWhy is it held?\nUSE → PPE · EARN (rent/value) → Investment property · SELL → Inventory\nTAS 40 = land & buildings only; rented-out cars = PPE\n⚠ shaky: put a rented-out building and rental cars in the wrong bucket (2 ghost cards). Car dealer split = right.","x":880,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"**2. Recognition** ✓\n① PROBABLE future benefits flow to the entity\n② cost MEASURED RELIABLY\n(never 'certain')\nsolid: built both conditions himself","x":880,"y":180,"width":380,"height":170,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n13","type":"text","text":"**4. Subsequent costs**\nrepairs → expense\nreplacement / major inspection → asset · s44\n26 Oct (GPT): covered · recheck: old component's CA is derecognised (not netted against the new cost) · major inspection = capitalise, routine cleaning = expense","x":880,"y":1620,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n15","type":"text","text":"Revaluation\nwhole class · method (a) proportional / (b) eliminate AD\n⚠ s54 + s57 have errors\n26 Oct: both methods ✓ (elimination step 2 slipped 50k→30k; skipped ratio/running balances on proportional). Surplus = FV − CA either way","x":1380,"y":1800,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n16","type":"text","text":"Up / down\nincrease → OCI surplus · decrease → P&L loss · reversals cross over · s61–65\n⚠ 26 Oct: first up → said 'gain' (it's OCI surplus) · cross-over excess → said OCI (it's P&L) · reversal of a P&L loss ✓","x":1380,"y":1980,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n17","type":"text","text":"Surplus → retained earnings\nnot through P&L · s66–67\n⚠ 26 Oct: said surplus is 'recognised on sale' TWICE → fixed: excess-dep transfer 10k/yr + sale → Dr surplus / Cr RE ✓","x":1380,"y":2160,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n14","type":"text","text":"**5. After recognition**\ncost model vs revaluation model · s46–67\n26 Oct: done in the Room, all sub-branches drilled","x":880,"y":1980,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n19","type":"text","text":"Methods\nstraight-line · sum-of-years' digits · declining balance · units · hours\n⚠ 26 Oct: straight-line ✓ · SYD forgotten → example → ✓ (150k/120k) · double-declining forgotten → used the example's rate + took residual out first → fixed ✓ (rate 2/n, on CA, residual = floor) · units: method ✓, rounded 0.222 → 99,900 (go per unit: ฿5 × 20k = 100k)","x":1380,"y":2340,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n20","type":"text","text":"Start / stop · reviews ← next\nchange = change in ESTIMATE\n26 Oct: depreciation starts when READY for use ✓ (warehouse Q). PAUSED here 13:22: next cold Q = change in estimate (500k, residual 50k, SL 5 yrs, after 2 yrs life revised to 4 MORE years → yr 3 = (320k − 50k) ÷ 4 = 67,500, prospective)","x":1380,"y":2520,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n21","type":"text","text":"Depletion\nnatural resources, per unit · s93–95","x":1380,"y":2700,"width":360,"height":150},
		{"id":"n18","type":"text","text":"**6. Depreciation** ← now\ncomponents · depreciable amount = cost − residual · s69–91","x":880,"y":2520,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n22","type":"text","text":"**7. Derecognition**\ngain/loss = proceeds − carrying amount\nnever revenue · s99–100","x":880,"y":2880,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n24","type":"text","text":"**Definition**\nidentifiable · no physical substance · non-monetary\n+ control + future benefits","x":880,"y":3060,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n26","type":"text","text":"R&D\nresearch → expense · development → capitalise once ALL 6 criteria met\nno reinstating old expenses","x":1380,"y":3240,"width":360,"height":150},
		{"id":"n27","type":"text","text":"Never an asset\ninternal goodwill · brands · mastheads · customer lists","x":1380,"y":3420,"width":360,"height":150},
		{"id":"n25","type":"text","text":"**Ways in**\npurchase · business combination · internal · gov grant · exchange","x":880,"y":3330,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n28","type":"text","text":"**After recognition**\ncost or revaluation (needs active market)","x":880,"y":3600,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n29","type":"text","text":"**Amortisation**\nfinite → amortise · indefinite → no, impairment test yearly","x":880,"y":3780,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n30","type":"text","text":"**Goodwill**\nprice − FV of net assets · not amortised","x":880,"y":3960,"width":380,"height":150},
		{"id":"n23","type":"text","text":"## Intangibles (TAS 38)\nSession 10 (17 Oct) · concepts only, Crow builds the numbers","x":420,"y":3510,"width":340,"height":150},
		{"id":"n31","type":"text","text":"## Impairment (TAS 36)\nSession 11 · 31 Oct · NOT TAUGHT YET\nin M2 only if the paper is after 31 Oct","x":420,"y":4140,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n32","type":"text","text":"## Investment property (TAS 40)\nSessions 12–13 → FINAL. Parked.","x":420,"y":4320,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"6"},
