		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"**Legend**\n🟩 done · 🟨 now · ⬜ not yet · 🟥 not taught · 🟪 parked\nCrow updates the colours as blocks close.\n🟧 shaky (see the ⚠ line)","x":0,"y":-260,"width":420,"height":170},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"## PPE (TAS 16, 23)\nSessions 8–9 · 101-slide deck","x":360,"y":1800,"width":340,"height":150},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"Exchange\nFV given up + cash · s23–24\n⚠ summed every number (200+120+90 = 410k): didn't know carrying amount = cost − acc dep (ghost card)\n⚠ commercial substance: not in deck\n26 Oct: two-transaction frame (sell old at FV, buy new) clicked → #32 loss version ✓ · #31 ✗ before it","x":2800,"y":1015,"width":360,"height":170,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n10","type":"text","text":"Donation\nFV · Cr capital or other income · s25\n⚠ 26 Oct: flipped giver/receiver TWICE (misread). Receiver: Dr asset at FV, fees capitalised (800k + 15k = 815k). Giver: out at CARRYING AMOUNT → donation expense","x":2800,"y":1195,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n11","type":"text","text":"Self-construction + borrowing costs (TAS 23)\nqualifying asset · capitalisation period · lesser of actual vs avoidable · s26–31\n⚠ 26 Oct: left construction interest out (500k vs 540k); thought capitalisation runs past READY (it stops; post-ready interest = expense). Depreciation starts when ready ✓","x":2800,"y":1375,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n12","type":"text","text":"Dismantling cost (ARO)\nPV into cost, unwind as interest · s36–41\n26 Oct (GPT): covered, strong on the entries · recheck: PV = time value, not certainty","x":2800,"y":1555,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"Basket purchase\nsplit by fair value · s18–19\nsolid on WHY (land not depreciated, different lives, revaluation by class)\n⚠ method right, slipped equipment (30k, should be 36k): always check the split adds to the price (ghost card)\nsolid: entry (Dr land/building/equipment, Cr cash); knows there's no 'discount' entry","x":2800,"y":435,"width":360,"height":170,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"Deferred payment\ncash price; the rest is interest · s20–21\n⚠ read 'instalments' (paying in parts) as 'installation'; under that reading 280,000 was logical. Concept itself: cost = CASH price, the extra = interest (ghost card)\nsolid: 1 Jan entry · ⚠ 30 June interest: used 250k × full year and 'interest payable'; it's 200k × 10% × 6/12 = 10,000 interest EXPENSE (ghost card)","x":2800,"y":615,"width":360,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"Issue shares for it ✓\nFV of the shares ON THE DATE · s22\nDr asset / Cr share capital (par) / Cr share premium (rest)\n⚠ first used par (100k), 'the price moves': cost is locked on the day (ghost card)\nsolid after: own words 'lock in on the date, only revaluation changes it' (fix: COST not worth; par = label)","x":2800,"y":795,"width":360,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"**3. Cost at acquisition**\nprice − trade discounts + directly attributable + dismantling (ARO)\nNOT: opening, ads, training, admin  · s15–42\nsolid: machine = 497,000, training out. Watch: he starts from inventory's net-purchase logic; the PPE test is 'location + working condition'\n26 Oct: all sub-branches touched · ⚠ recheck cost totals as ONE number (250k + 13k = 263k, missed twice)","x":880,"y":945,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"2"},
